00:03:42.621 --> 00:03:46.292 align:start position:0%
So we've been told
that there's a channel marker
over there on some rocks.

00:03:46.325 --> 00:03:47.893 align:start position:0%
And if you take
the boat around it,

00:03:47.926 --> 00:03:49.729 align:start position:0%
